  "binary": "opencode 2.1.4",
  "method": [
    "Each run: own systemd-run --user --scope -p MemoryMax=4G (memory.max 4294967296 recorded); memory.events read from the scope before and after.",
    "Fresh profile (HOME/XDG_*/TMPDIR under the run dir), one scratch git repo, mock provider in OPENCODE_CONFIG_CONTENT (mg-mock.ts, GATE_ABORT_MS=180000 holds every response open), OPENCODE_DISABLE_MODELS_FETCH=1, OPENCODE_DISABLE_FREE_MODELS=1, proxies to a closed port.",
    "Idle: after /api/info healthy, GET /api/plugin for the repo location, then 8 s; created-idle: N POST /api/session in the repo, then 3 s; mid-turn: N concurrent POST /api/session/:id/prompt with GATE_ABORT, wait until every session has session.execution.started and session.step.started with no terminal event and the mock holds >= N requests, then 3 s, then sample, then re-check busy.",
    "Sample = sum over the server pid and every descendant (ppid walk over /proc/*/stat) of Rss and Pss from /proc/<pid>/smaps_rollup. The mock is not counted.",
    "Then interrupt (resume=false) every session, SIGTERM the server."
  ],
